  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第三十一关（前）\np.m.8:36 / 雨天 / 視界：12km\nロドス本艦"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ケルシー",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "戻ったか。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "……はい。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ケルシー",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ケルシー",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "偵察チームから詳細は聞いている。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ケルシー",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "アーミヤ、手を診せてくれ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "いえ、大丈夫ですから……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ケルシー",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "……アーミヤ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "……わかりました。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ケルシー",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "…………"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ケルシー",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "幸い、指輪に亀裂や変色などはないようだな。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ケルシー",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "だが、次もこう上手くいくとは限らない。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ケルシー",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "改めて言っておくが――"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ケルシー",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "くれぐれも、気をつけるように。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "はい。……あの、先生……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "……少し、休んでもいいでしょうか。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ケルシー",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "ああ、行きなさい。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "ありがとうございます……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ケルシー",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "――"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ケルシー",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "この件は、君にも責任がある。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ケルシー",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "二度と、彼女をこうした危険な目には遭わせないようにしてもらいたいものだ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ケルシー",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "加えて、アーミヤのあの様子は、陰鬱な感情に囚われているように見受けられる。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ケルシー",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "これは思わしくない傾向だ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ケルシー",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "恐らく、君がロドスへ戻ってきた際にも、彼女は今と同様の表情をしていたことだろうが……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ケルシー",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "……ともあれ、Dr.{@nickname}。今は、彼女のそばにいてやってくれ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ケルシー",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "ただし、下手な真似はしないように。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "（ノックをする）",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "開いていますよ、どうぞ。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "……ドクター……？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "悩みごと……？　私が、ですか？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#10",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "……あはは……お見通しでしたか。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "ちゃんと隠せてるつもりだったんですけど……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "確かに、少し……ほんの少しだけ、悩んでいることがあるんです。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "でも、それを我慢するのにも慣れてきてしまって。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "やっぱり、みなさんの負担を増やすわけにはいきませんし……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "ドクターも、そう思いますよね？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "……私、わからないんです。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "一体、どうしたらいいのか……"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "…………",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "……もちろん、自分たちのしていることは理解していますし、その過程で犠牲は避けられないということもわかっているつもりです。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "それでも……どうしても、わからないんです。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "私たちは、なぜ……本当は救えたはずの人たちが、目の前から消えていくのを見過ごすことしかできないんでしょうか？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "あと少し、手を伸ばせたら……きっと、届くはずなのに。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "……自分が負うべき責任のことは、理解しています。……ですから私は、これからもこの歩みを止めはしません。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "けれど、今は……どうにも、疲れてしまいました。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "……"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "……",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "アーミヤ……",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "……ドクター。気にかけてくれたこと、ありがとうございます。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "しばらく、一人にしてもらってもいいですか？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "おはようございます、Dr.{@nickname}。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "あっ、ケルシー先生もいらしたんですね。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "ケルシー",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "ああ。……少し、話があってな。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "ケルシー",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "急を要する仕事で、いくらか人手が必要になった。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "ケルシー",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "――龍門郊外に、廃墟となった移動都市が発見されたんだ。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "ケルシー",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "私の推測が正しければ、チェルノボーグ事変の際に離脱した都市の一つだろう。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "ケルシー",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "ついては、市街地を探索して情報収集を行うと共に、生存者の有無を確かめる必要がある。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "ケルシー",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "仮に、レユニオンの潜伏が確認されるなど、より深刻な状況が発覚した場合には、我々の今後の動きにも大きく影響を及ぼすことになるだろうしな。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "ケルシー",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "具体的な作戦内容はここにまとめてある。時間のある時に目を通してくれ。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "わかりました。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "ケルシー",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "ああ、それと……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "ケルシー",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "フランカから受け取った報告書によると、彼女たちはBSWに帰還する必要があるそうだ。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "ケルシー",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "加えて、ペンギン急便からは、龍門のスラム街の状況について、現地で君と意見交換を行いたいと連絡を受けている。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "ケルシー",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "実際に見ておくべき細かな事情が存在する、ということだろう。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "でしたら、今から行ってきます。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "ドクターも一緒に――"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "ケルシー",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "いや。Dr.{@nickname}には、まだ話しておきたいことがある。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "――ええと……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "私も同席していいですか？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "ケルシー",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "駄目だ。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#3",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "ちゃんと耳を塞いでおきますから――"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "ケルシー",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "駄目だと言っただろう。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#5",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "う～……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "ケルシー先生、あまりドクターを困らせないでくださいね。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "ケルシー",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "わかっている。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "ケルシー",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1#3",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "……さて。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "ケルシー",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1#3",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "彼女に寄り添うことすら、まともにこなせないとはな。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "ケルシー",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "まあいい。この結果は予想していた。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "ケルシー",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "――アーミヤは、本当に強い子だ。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "ケルシー",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "しかし、どんなに堅い殻で己を守っていたとしても、強い圧力を受け続ければ、いずれは押し潰されてしまうもの……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "ケルシー",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "君には、そうした事態が訪れないようにしてもらいたい。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "ケルシー",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "ゆえに、次に同様の事象が発生することがあれば、もう少し良い働きを期待したいものだ。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "ケルシー",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "――？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "ケルシー",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "その表情は何だ。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "一つ聞かせてほしい。アーミヤの指輪は何なんだ？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "ケルシー",
              "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1#2",
              "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
              "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
              "text": "あれは、彼女の身体状況に関係している物だ。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "ケルシー",
              "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1#2",
              "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
              "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
              "text": "それ以上のことは、まだ教えられない。ただ、一点だけ注意すべきことを伝えるとするなら……"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "ケルシー",
              "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1#2",
              "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
              "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
              "text": "この先、仮にアーミヤが激しい戦闘に巻き込まれることがあれば――"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "ケルシー",
              "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1#2",
              "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
              "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
              "text": "――状況が落ち着き次第、すぐに指輪の状態を確認するよう心がけてくれ。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "ケルシー",
              "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
              "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
              "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
              "text": "なお、その際指輪に少しでも変化が見られた場合には、必ず私に報告するように。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "ケルシー",
              "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
              "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
              "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
              "text": "……ああ、それと。別件だが、二日後に検査センターで、君の身体検査を行う予定がある。忘れてくれるなよ。"
            },
            {
              "type": "sceneBreak"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "ケルシー",
              "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
              "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
              "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
              "text": "――用件は以上だ。すでに、リスカムが君の護衛のため廊下で待機している。行ってやると良い。"
            },
            {
              "type": "sceneBreak"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "……",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    }
